+*   `chunk_size`: Number of rays (or samples) processed per iteration. Default inference value is often `chunk_size // 1024` if not specified, or defaults to 65536 (1024 * 64) [S3, unofficial].
+*   `raymarching_tolerance`: Threshold for early stopping. If > 0, rays terminate when accumulated free energy exceeds `-log(tolerance)` [S3, unofficial]. Default is 0.0 [S3, unofficial].
